1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,920
What if every lie you told made you one centimetre shorter?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,920
Monday. Your boss asks if you read his email.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,420
Your friend asks how her new haircut looks.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,920
By lunch, you're eleven centimetres shorter. Your trousers notice first.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,920
By Friday, you need a ladder for the coffee machine.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,920
But here's the twist. Everyone else is shrinking too.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,920
Doors get lower. Cars get tiny. Basketball gets weird.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,920
Then your friend plays you her new song. It's terrible.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,920
So, for once, you tell the truth.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,920
And for the first time all week, you don't shrink.

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,920
So be honest. How tall would you be by Friday?
